WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.910
Born of heaven and earth, 
yin and yang, and all of creation,

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:16.540
I am a body, possessing vision, 
hearing, smell, taste, touch, and thought.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.150
Pure I am, to cut through evil,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.940
and open now a world without light,

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.510
that all who live may be born anew.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:57.630
In three days, we can at 
last perform the ceremony.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.420
The ceremony to, for the 
first time in 60 years,

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.560
appoint a new reigning 
princess in my place.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.760
Twelve Shinsho, I rely upon you.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.230
Understood.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:13.520
We, the Twelve Shinsho, 
pledge our eternal allegiance

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.340
to the protection of the new princess.

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:20.990
Princess Kikuri, I pray your 
heart may rest at ease.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:28.200
My duty is at last complete.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.500
Onii-chan, breakfast is ready.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:54.510
Hey, haven't I told 
you to at least knock?

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:59.970
The Life of Arata

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:58.150
I'll walk partway to school with you.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.970
 Don't bother. What am I, a kid?

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.430
Morning, Arata.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.400
Morning, Mom.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.590
So Onii-chan can smile now.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.320
He says he's made a 
friend at school, too.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.520
A best friend, even.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.230
That's great.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.400
I guess he's not being bullied anymore.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.200
Onii-chan is so nice and has a sense 
of justice. He's a good person.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.430
It made no sense that those 
things happened to him.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:28.100
Arata!

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.370
Morning!

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.630
Hey, Suguru.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.190
Oh, yeah...

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.530
The game I told you about.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.470
Thanks! I'll borrow this for a while!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:39.970
Sure.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.630
<i>I'm going to be okay.</i>

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.150
What do you wanna do after this?

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:52.440
Karaoke?

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.150
Haven't we done enough karaoke?

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.730
11.58 seconds. That's a good time.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.890
Especially considering you dropped 
your speed at the end.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.230
I did not!

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.110
Liar.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:30.980
But, Hinohara, with a time like 
this, are you sure you won't join?

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.610
Sorry. I'm not really into sports.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:38.180
Why won't the first years 
join the track team?

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.580
Weren't you strong in middle school?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.230
Both you and Kadowaki.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:48.200
You don't want to let your 
guard down, Hinohara.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:52.710
Nothing's changed just because 
we're in high school now.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.620
I won't acknowledge you.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:00.990
Yeah...

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:08.470
I-I've been sick of Hinohara lately, too.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.770
Oh, you have?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.540
You should've said something sooner!

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:17.350
Yeah, we thought you 
were Hinohara's friend.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:18.440
No way!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:22.900
Hinohara and I were never friends.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.320
Arata!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:32.910
Arata!

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.100
Arata!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.510
Arata! Resign yourself already!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.640
Shut up! I'm never gonna do it!

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.220
If you're a man, then show some resolve!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.650
I refuse <i>because</i> I'm a man!

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.220
You won't get away!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.530
He fell...

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.290
That hurt!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:11.120
Who uses Amatsuriki on their grandson?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.620
Shut up! Starting today, 
Arata, you are a woman!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.450
As the daughter of the Hime Clan, you will 
attend the ceremony held once every 30 years

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.140
and become the new 
ruling princess of this nation!

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.420
I told you, that's just not possible!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.840
Do not worry, Master Arata.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.970
We of the Uneme Clan will 
help you dress like a girl.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:30.850
Get out of here, Kotoha.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.280
Whether I dress like a girl or not,

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:37.060
I'm a guy. I can't just become the princess.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.190
Only a daughter of the Hime Clan who

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.030
possesses Amatsuriki can become 
the ruler of Amawakuni.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:50.380
However, our clan has not been blessed 
with a daughter in many years.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.490
I knew it...

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:55.330
We should have raised you as a girl!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.150
That's not the issue!

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:59.100
I'm a guy, so I don't have Amatsuriki,

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.480
and if I'm discovered, I'll be killed!

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.840
You'll be killed even if you refuse!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:02.800
What?

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.270
It has been declared that if 
we do not offer a daughter,

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:10.000
the entire Hime Clan will be 
purged as punishment for treason.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.760
The entire clan?

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.940
I can accept my own death, but Arata, 
you must survive and protect the clan.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.740
Protect the Hayagami,

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.900
the divine Goshintai 
handed down by our ancestors.

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.390
What, this thing?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.530
Fool! If you don't treat it with respect, 
you'll bring the wrath of the gods!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.080
Oh...

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.310
Nothing's happening.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.080
What's all this Goshintai business?

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.610
It's just a ratty old sword.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.000
You accursed wretch!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.200
Gram!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.260
Mistress Makari!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.880
Are you all right, Gram? Hey...

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.180
Sorry, Arata.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.840
The mistress is growing restless.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.480
Only a daughter of the Hime 
Clan who possesses Amatsuriki

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:11.460
can subdue the Hayagami, 
the gods of our world.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.090
Princess Kokuri is aging.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.260
The clan had no daughters 
30 years ago, either,

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.010
so she has reigned for 60 years.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:23.550
The survival of our nation 
depends upon this ceremony.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.880
Say what you will...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.530
But this still sucks.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.410
You look adorable, Master Arata!

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.950
You really look like a girl!

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.050
I'll pound you!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.060
So this is just to buy time while we search 
for a real daughter of the Hime Clan, huh?

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.110
The ceremony lasts three days.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.310
You need only hold out that long.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:49.110
You think we can fool the princess and 
her Twelve Shinsho for three days?

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.980
Well...

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.330
I want to disappear 
to some faraway world.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.580
Master Arata.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:05.750
What's that?

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.970
The Michihi-no-tama.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:12.190
A charm I received from Princess Kikuri 
when I served her in the capital.

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.180
From the princess?

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.640
This is all I can do.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.760
Don't worry.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.420
I'd have to be a real lowlife 
to let Gram be killed.

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:28.290
Let's just see how well we can 
deceive the mistress, huh?

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.650
It has begun...

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.330
The first ceremony in 30 years...

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.150
And the birth of a new princess!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.880
Kotoha, get back to the 
village as soon as you can.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.170
Get the villagers someplace far away

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.760
while I spend three days buying us time.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:02.310
Got it?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.770
<i>Master Arata...</i>

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.930
<i>Don't say something so 
sad with such grace.</i>

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:23.470
<i>That's where the Twelve Shinsho are...</i>

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.330
You are Arata,

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:32.050
the new princess who is to succeed me?

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.210
<i>That's the princess?</i>

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.840
<i>She's not an old crone?</i>

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.880
You needn't worry. 
Entrust everything to me.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.820
I was nervous at first, as well.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.020
It's all right.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:49.830
Calm your spirit, Arata.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.220
I thank you for coming.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.690
It must have been painful 
to leave those you love.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.450
Forgive me, Arata.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.730
<i>I can't do it.</i>

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.190
<i>I can't possibly deceive her.</i>

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.010
K-Kannagi...

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.710
How dare you?!

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:01.680
Weak.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:05.790
Princess!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:08.850
A man?

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:12.480
I don't know what you're 
scheming, but fine.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.110
Sorry, but you'll have to die.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.820
Hey! Someone!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.750
Twelve Shinsho! What are 
you just staring for?!

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:23.120
The princess is...

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.330
Do something! Hey!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.950
Can't you hear me?!

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.680
What is going on?!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:39.670
This is the revolution 
of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.360
The flames have gone out!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:58.880
Did something happen?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.820
Master Arata?!

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.110
All of you, listen to me!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:07.450
The princess has been killed!

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.910
The traitor's name is Arata.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:15.210
He came in the guise of a woman, 
murdered the princess, and fled.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:19.630
Apprehend the traitor to our nation 
at all costs, and execute him!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.490
Damn it!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.350
Did you hear?

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.340
Yeah. What's going to happen no—

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.070
S-Sorry!

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:43.990
The Kando Forest?

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.700
Yes. We've received multiple reports.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:50.150
They say the traitor is 
headed for the Kando Forest.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.660
What a fool.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:54.930
The forest will eat him alive.

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:01.260
Even if he survives...

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.340
<i>Master Arata!</i>

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:09.500
Arata...

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.300
<i>Revolution?</i>

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.780
<i>The Twelve Shinsho 
betrayed the princess?!</i>

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.050
I'll never trust anyone again.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.330
Suguru and Kadowaki...

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.780
They can all just disappear.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:38.920
What's going on?

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:40.330
No...

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.930
I'm the one who should disappear.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:48.010
Someone, I don't care who...

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.020
Just make me disappear.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.750
Arata!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.440
Master Arata!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:01.830
Arata.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.100
Arata...

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:04.880
Arata.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.360
You won't get away from me, Hinohara.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.640
What happened?

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.680
Where am I?

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.060
Am I dreaming?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.290
You have nowhere to run, Arata.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.700
Murdering the princess 
is a heinous crime.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.400
Be devoured by the forest, 
or be killed by me.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.050
Your choice.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.880
What's going on? Who are you?

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.210
The forest must have 
devoured your memory.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.930
What is this? What's going on?!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.860
Master Arata!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.440
I'm so glad you're all right!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.160
U-Um, wait, who are you?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.500
I'm Kotoha.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.880
No, really, who <i>are</i> you?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.910
Oh, this is no time for games!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.340
We have to get out of 
here or they'll catch—

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.360
Don't lose them! After them!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:56.100
That signal...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:56.610
Go.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:57.330
Yes, sir!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.860
<i>What the hell is going on?</i>

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:08.090
How did he escape the Kando Forest?

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.120
You failed, Kannagi.

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:20.580
Akachi...

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.760
You could overtake that boy 
easily with your Hayagami.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.720
With the great Kamui?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.960
Such power is wasted on a brat like him.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:32.880
Don't worry. I will stop him.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.180
I can trust you, correct?

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.580
Yes. I swear on my Hayagami.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:45.100
Nothing less from the princess.

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:48.230
So she used her final Amatsuriki?

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:51.730
But there's nothing more she 
can do now that she's at death's door.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.070
Our revolution is a success.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:58.890
Yes. The Amatsuriki that 
oppressed us is gone,

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:00.790
and the Hayagami have been freed.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:06.230
Now begins the era of the 
reign of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.930
What is wrong, Arata?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.600
Isn't the ceremony still going on?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.020
Mistress Makari, Princess 
Kikuri was murdered.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.610
And everyone believes that 
Master Arata is the killer.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:31.800
What?!

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:32.780
The princess?!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:37.530
But Master Arata himself 
has lost his memory.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.690
No, I told you, I'm Hinohara Arata.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:43.490
I'm not the same guy 
as this Master Arata.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:46.730
He spoke nothing but such nonsense 
as this all the way home.

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:50.080
Mistress Makari, it 
looks like Master Arata

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.340
was devoured by the Kando Forest!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.950
What?! The Kando Forest?!

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.300
It can't be...

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:03.770
I see.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.800
So you came to Amawakuni 
from a land called Japan.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:12.650
You look like none other than 
my grandson Arata to my eyes.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:15.130
Um, could I...

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.930
There is a legend of the Kando Forest.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.970
When those devoured by the forest 
return, they are completely changed.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:28.200
Who knew it meant they had switched places 
with someone living in another world?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.790
Switch places? That could never...

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.560
If... If that really did happen,

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.100
how can I...

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.770
You cannot go back.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.440
You can only live as the 
Arata of this world.

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.430
Don't joke around!

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.310
The Arata here is a criminal, isn't he?!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.780
I don't want to be caught 
and killed in his place!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.050
Arata would not do such a thing!

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.780
I believe in my grandson!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.450
What the hell?

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.020
This is pathetic.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.920
I'm bullied at school, 
betrayed by my friend,

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.920
and now this?

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:17.840
Kotoha?

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:24.490
Are you the elder of the Hime Clan?

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.140
Where is Arata?

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.600
He is not here.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:35.230
This has nothing to do with me! 
I'm not the Arata of this world!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:38.820
Woman, you are his 
maid-in-waiting, correct?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.280
Where is he?

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.910
I-I don't know!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:50.200
You don't want to die 
protecting a criminal, do you?

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.590
M-Master Arata is not a criminal!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.720
Even if you kill me, I...

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:59.590
I trust Master Arata!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.970
But if you trust anyone...

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.040
you'll only get betrayed.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.130
If you trust anyone...

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.990
They you shall have your wish.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.610
Let her go.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.380
Master Arata!

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.360
You're Kotoha, right?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:31.370
You and the granny really 
trust this Arata, don't you?

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.300
Master Arata, run!

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.120
You're all wrong.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.840
I'm not Arata, and I have 
no idea what's going on.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.890
I'll never trust anyone again.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.830
Honestly, I'm scared to death.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:53.370
But standing by and watching people 
who trust someone get killed

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.350
is even more wrong!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:58.230
Kill him.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.080
A Hayagami?

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:19.670
You're just the same as 
Kadowaki and all those guys.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.960
Ganging up on one person...

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:23.920
Just lay off already!

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:29.990
What...

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:31.260
...is this?

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:32.930
It can't be!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.640
Even if that is a Hayagami,

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:39.480
only one who is chosen can wield it.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:41.930
Appear...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.130
Hayagami Homura!

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:49.120
Master Arata!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.120
Say "appear!"

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:53.040
Appear!

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.560
Hayagami... It's a god?

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:45.170
Don't worry. I know you 
will return to normal.

00:23:45.170 --> 00:23:46.870
Who are you?

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:48.600
Can I trust you?

00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:51.660
Mom, I'm here!

00:23:50.930 --> 00:25:00.000
Hayagami

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.230
Cut the crap... Just cut the crap!
